# Platform stack

- Domain: `silvervibe.io` (Cloudflare DNS).
- Frontends (`silvervibe`, `vibestandup`): Cloudflare Pages.
- Nest API (`api`) and LangGraph (`ai`): Google Cloud Run.
- Auth: Firebase Auth. Nest verifies Firebase JWTs; Postgres stores `firebase_uid`.
- Database: Neon Postgres. Prefer Prisma in `libs/shared/data-access` (planned). Do not use Firestore as the primary app DB.
- Feature flags: OpenFeature in Nest/Angular, GrowthBook as the provider. Workspace tool access lives in Postgres entitlements (`workspace_tools`), not only in flags.
- Secrets: environment variables / Secret Manager. Never commit `.env`.
- Add-ons (Slack, Teams, Jira, Linear, GitHub) stay Nest modules under `apps/api/src/app/addons/`.
